{
  "movie_id": 520100901,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 7.2,
      "end_time": 8.1,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 18.6,
      "end_time": 19.8,
      "text": "Ah~"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 31.0,
      "end_time": 32.3,
      "text": "...Aaaghhh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 36.1,
      "end_time": 37.4,
      "text": "......You......"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 37.6,
      "end_time": 38.4,
      "text": "Kid"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 38.6,
      "end_time": 40.3,
      "text": "It's best you go on ahead."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 41.0,
      "end_time": 43.0,
      "text": "As for your path, I'll──"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 44.0,
      "end_time": 46.0,
      "text": "We'll all pave the way!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 47.0,
      "end_time": 48.3,
      "text": "I'm with you, too!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 48.5,
      "end_time": 49.3,
      "text": "Yeah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 56.2,
      "end_time": 58.5,
      "text": "Uoooh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 61.2,
      "end_time": 63.4,
      "text": "Carving a path is quite the hassle..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 64.0,
      "end_time": 65.6,
      "text": "...until everything is destroyed!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 67.9,
      "end_time": 68.5,
      "text": "Mana!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 68.7,
      "end_time": 72.1,
      "text": "I ask you not to refer to me so casually, Professor."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 80.5,
      "end_time": 83.1,
      "text": "Isn't that too much to handle for an old man like you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 83.5,
      "end_time": 84.2,
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 84.4,
      "end_time": 89.6,
      "text": "A wonderful development, seeing how far you've come in considering others in the short time we've been apart, Mana."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 89.9,
      "end_time": 91.5,
      "text": "Tsk...I was being sarcastic."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 96.8,
      "end_time": 99.5,
      "text": "Can you handle this, Utsushimi Neneka?"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 99.8,
      "end_time": 102.3,
      "text": "Yes, I am grateful for your guidance."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 102.5,
      "end_time": 103.5,
      "text": "Gregor"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 108.9,
      "end_time": 109.7,
      "text": "Chris"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 109.9,
      "end_time": 112.6,
      "text": "If I'm called upon, I will respond in kind!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 113.9,
      "end_time": 114.8,
      "text": "Akira"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 122.9,
      "end_time": 125.4,
      "text": "I also have to show off every once in a while!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 129.6,
      "end_time": 133.1,
      "text": "Alright, wide open! Now, boy, the rest is──"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 133.3,
      "end_time": 134.4,
      "text": "?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 135.2,
      "end_time": 137.4,
      "text": "It's planning on blowing itself up...?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 141.8,
      "end_time": 143.2,
      "text": "?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 144.3,
      "end_time": 146.6,
      "text": "......So all of the Crowns came after all...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 147.3,
      "end_time": 148.2,
      "text": "Yeah..."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 152.3,
      "end_time": 154.4,
      "text": "Haaaaaaaaah!"
    }
  ],
